# Environment template (12 §5). Copy to `.env` and fill in locally.
#
# `.env` is gitignored. NOTHING in this repository may ever contain a real
# credential: it is public (ADR-011), and 12 §5's rule applies to every commit,
# not prospectively. CI reads secrets from repository secrets only.

# --- Toolchain (12 §1) ------------------------------------------------------

# OptiX SDK root. One env var name, deliberately version-agnostic — the version
# is recorded in 12 §1 and in no identifier. CMake enables the OptiX targets
# only when this resolves to a directory containing include/optix.h, so leaving
# it unset simply builds without them (M6+ only).
# OPTIX_SDK_ROOT=C:\ProgramData\NVIDIA Corporation\OptiX SDK 9.1.0

# vcpkg root. The win-x64 preset pins C:/vcpkg itself; the Linux presets read
# this (12 §1).
# VCPKG_ROOT=/usr/local/share/vcpkg

# --- Artifact storage (12 §4, M5-T5) ---------------------------------------
# Run bundles and field dumps go to object storage; only gate reports and the
# perf trend are committed (02 §2, QC-07).

# S3_ENDPOINT=
# S3_BUCKET=
# S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
# S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
# S3_REGION=

# --- Cloud sweeps (12 §3, optional, M5-T5) ---------------------------------

# RUNPOD_API_KEY=
# RUNPOD_POD_ID=
